WEBVTT

00:03:07.355 --> 00:03:09.772
Sahaja yogis should not fall to such a level

00:03:10.313 --> 00:03:14.647
of mundane type of people after all what is going to happen to you

00:03:14.689 --> 00:03:19.064
I would say those who have been worrying and all that,

00:03:19.106 --> 00:03:21.563
should go into great meditation and understand

00:03:21.605 --> 00:03:25.480
that you are insulting yourself. You are saints;

00:03:25.522 --> 00:03:27.730
why should you worry about what plane you are going to get,

00:03:27.772 --> 00:03:31.855
what you are not going to get? Shows that your level is very low;

00:03:31.897 --> 00:03:34.313
definitely; all those who have worried.

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:40.855
You have come here under My protection,

00:03:40.897 --> 00:03:51.563
and you will go back under My protection.

00:03:51.605 --> 00:03:57.772
I got so sick this morning that I was thinking we’ll not have any poojas.

00:03:57.772 --> 00:04:00.147
You must know that you are all part and parcel of My being;

00:04:00.189 --> 00:04:08.397
I have put you in My body and you have to behave yourself.

00:04:08.397 --> 00:04:18.313
on such an auspicious day, when we have all come here

00:04:18.355 --> 00:04:27.064
to do this special pooja, and I would say this should be called

00:04:27.106 --> 00:04:31.981
as a Mahalakshmi Pooja because it’s something to do

00:04:31.981 --> 00:04:35.897
with the industry of this country, and of the whole world.

00:04:35.939 --> 00:04:45.939
Unless and until all those human ventures are connected with God

00:04:45.981 --> 00:04:51.772
they cannot get their perfect stage and their status.

00:04:51.814 --> 00:04:55.563
That’s why we have problems now in the West.

00:04:55.605 --> 00:04:58.689
Supposed to be very clever people, very smart,

00:04:58.689 --> 00:05:03.605
very well equipped, well educated. We are having recessions

00:05:03.647 --> 00:05:06.647
and things because they have no balance.

00:05:06.647 --> 00:05:12.106
They don’t know that there is God’s power which works everything,

00:05:12.147 --> 00:05:16.438
and when you neglect that, this is what happens to you.

00:05:16.438 --> 00:05:28.106
Now for any venture that we do of this kind,

00:05:28.106 --> 00:05:33.438
first of all we have to use a lot of material from the Mother Earth,

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:40.981
but if it is taken for a proper purpose, for constructive things

00:05:41.022 --> 00:05:45.897
and for helping others, with a balance,

00:05:45.939 --> 00:05:53.563
then Mother Earth can think, She can produce, more and more,

00:05:53.563 --> 00:05:56.022
all this She has produced before.

00:05:56.064 --> 00:05:58.814
She can produce for people who are sensible,

00:05:58.855 --> 00:06:08.522
who are in tune with God, not just making money for themselves,

00:06:08.563 --> 00:06:20.022
or for their own purpose, but are thinking in totality,

00:06:20.022 --> 00:06:25.563
thinking as to what we can achieve by doing this.

00:06:25.605 --> 00:06:32.064
And that is how an industry can grow.

00:06:32.106 --> 00:06:35.563
Now we see in Japan so much industry has grown,

00:06:35.605 --> 00:06:40.605
but no spirituality. They are not at all happy people.

00:06:40.647 --> 00:06:46.772
Their children are suffering, families are suffering.

00:06:46.772 --> 00:06:54.939
Money cannot get the total well being of a human being.

00:06:54.981 --> 00:06:59.147
So a balance has to be drawn.

00:06:59.147 --> 00:07:04.064
Especially in our country, thank God, we didn’t have

00:07:04.064 --> 00:07:09.814
such a fast industrialization, and that’s why we are saved

00:07:09.814 --> 00:07:12.522
of lots of problems that the Western people are suffering,

00:07:12.563 --> 00:07:15.147
about which the Indians are not aware.

00:07:15.189 --> 00:07:19.855
They think you are all living in a very comfortable life there.

00:07:19.897 --> 00:07:28.064
Industry has to go hand-in-hand with the handicrafts,

00:07:28.064 --> 00:07:35.064
and the industrialists have to also look after the artists,

00:07:35.106 --> 00:07:38.814
because otherwise who will look after them?

00:07:38.855 --> 00:07:42.772
How will they bring forth the balance between the art and the industry?

00:07:42.814 --> 00:07:48.147
And art is such a soothing thing for these hard-working people.

00:07:48.147 --> 00:07:52.064
They work the whole day, then there is some sort of a music,

00:07:52.064 --> 00:08:02.022
art, to console them, to give them peace, to relax them,

00:08:02.064 --> 00:08:09.522
and a balance. So I would say that all industries

00:08:09.563 --> 00:08:16.522
must take to some artistic ventures also, or they should also produce things.

00:08:16.522 --> 00:08:20.939
After I was telling Rajesh many a times that you should try to produce

00:08:20.981 --> 00:08:26.480
something artistic out of the steel scrap that is left over, will be a good idea.

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.355
They have tried something like that.

00:08:28.397 --> 00:08:35.730
But industry should not be looked down upon

00:08:35.772 --> 00:08:38.189
as it is looked down upon in our country.

00:08:38.231 --> 00:08:40.772
I mean, as if industrialists are the greatest thieves

00:08:40.814 --> 00:08:46.022
and all the politicians are saints in this country. It’s the other way around I think.

00:08:46.022 --> 00:08:48.772
It should be treated with respect,

00:08:48.814 --> 00:08:50.939
and should be understood that it’s very important.

00:08:50.981 --> 00:08:56.522
And the industrialists, if they become also enlightened,

00:08:56.522 --> 00:09:02.897
they can do a lot, not only to their own country,

00:09:02.939 --> 00:09:05.772
but also to the people whom they are looking after.

00:09:05.814 --> 00:09:08.730
So in the Mahalakshmi principle,

00:09:08.772 --> 00:09:13.022
Mahalakshmi has various mudras [postures].

00:09:13.064 --> 00:09:20.855
One of the mudra is that She puts Her right hand like this.

00:09:20.855 --> 00:09:26.313
Now this right hand is to give protection to people

00:09:26.313 --> 00:09:32.772
who are under the protection, or under the service,

00:09:32.772 --> 00:09:35.605
of some rich man, or the industrialist we can call it.

00:09:35.605 --> 00:09:39.689
In India if you call somebody a rich man it’s like abusing him.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:43.480
Nobody likes it, because the rich are always shown

00:09:43.522 --> 00:09:45.981
to be the worst people, which is not so.

00:09:46.022 --> 00:09:50.272
In My own experience it’s not so. If there’s a poor man also he could be terrible.

00:09:50.313 --> 00:09:53.605
We have had very bad experiences now, in Ganapatipule,

00:09:53.647 --> 00:09:55.772
of very poor people how they behaved

00:09:55.814 --> 00:09:59.438
in a very funny manner - supposed to be poor.

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:10.438
So it should be a proper balance, it should be brought to a proper balance,

00:10:10.438 --> 00:10:15.939
between the understanding of the poor and the rich, and the rich and the poor.

00:10:15.981 --> 00:10:23.939
After some time you will find that people will not consider poverty

00:10:23.981 --> 00:10:30.689
or riches as so important, but the richness of the spirit

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.147
will become very important.

00:10:33.189 --> 00:10:36.271
That is what is going to be the Sahaj nations

00:10:36.271 --> 00:10:40.855
where the richness of the heart, the spirituality,

00:10:40.855 --> 00:10:46.064
oneness with the Divine, will become the greatest boon

00:10:46.106 --> 00:10:52.563
for everyone. But still we are struggling

00:10:52.605 --> 00:10:59.480
to be on that state; many are; and still we go into materialistic tantrums

00:10:59.522 --> 00:11:05.522
or some sort of a stupid worrying fall.

00:11:05.563 --> 00:11:09.106
All these must be carefully watched.

00:11:09.147 --> 00:11:16.313
If you can keep this chariot of new progress

00:11:16.355 --> 00:11:18.730
progressing faster

00:11:18.772 --> 00:11:22.981
we are going to create a new world of complete harmony,

00:11:22.981 --> 00:11:28.189
complete peace, joy and love. But for that

00:11:28.189 --> 00:11:34.397
you are the ones who have to do it. I cannot do it.

00:11:34.438 --> 00:11:35.730
If I could have done it

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:37.647
I would not have asked you to join Sahaja Yoga.

00:11:37.689 --> 00:11:40.522
It’s like the horses and the charioteer;

00:11:40.522 --> 00:11:48.397
horses are to be driven; charioteer doesn’t drive the chariot.

00:11:48.438 --> 00:11:52.855
In the same way you must understand your responsibility

00:11:52.855 --> 00:11:55.563
that this is the greatest work we are doing.

00:11:55.605 --> 00:12:04.355
It’s not only the industry, or the labor and the capital,

00:12:04.397 --> 00:12:08.814
I’m talking about, but I’m talking about the totality of well being.

00:12:08.814 --> 00:12:13.981
Of course all of this is a part and parcel of that, no doubt.

00:12:14.022 --> 00:12:17.772
But the balance should be with the totality.

00:12:17.814 --> 00:12:22.522
So we have to think of a total well being.

00:12:22.563 --> 00:12:26.814
Once we start thinking of the total well being then –

00:12:26.855 --> 00:12:28.480
first thing that should come to us:

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:33.397
Are we capable of bringing up that total well being? Are we?

00:12:33.397 --> 00:12:39.438
Have we got the total well being within ourselves or not? Have we?

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:42.106
We are still worried if the plane is coming or not,

00:12:42.106 --> 00:12:45.271
I mean, we are so mundane, so little, so small.

00:12:45.271 --> 00:12:54.313
With one Bandhan you can control any plane, any atmosphere,

00:12:54.313 --> 00:12:58.397
and here you are, I mean, still worried about things

00:12:58.438 --> 00:13:01.313
which are absolutely under your control.

00:13:01.355 --> 00:13:06.522
So this totality has to be thought over.

00:13:06.522 --> 00:13:10.897
What is this totality that Mother is talking about?

00:13:10.897 --> 00:13:18.106
In this totality a world has to be created of people,

00:13:18.106 --> 00:13:32.022
by the people, who have no fear. This fear has to be given up.

00:13:32.064 --> 00:13:35.563
Behind all this nonsensical nervousness is fear.

00:13:35.563 --> 00:13:43.480
So for that, what She does is to give ‘अभयदान [‘Abhaydaan’—gift of fearlessness]

00:13:43.522 --> 00:13:50.231
Under Her protection you are beyond fear, you are protected.

00:13:50.271 --> 00:13:53.272
But if you do not want to believe in yourself,

00:13:53.313 --> 00:13:59.313
and you don’t believe into Her protection, then no body can help you,

00:13:59.355 --> 00:14:02.772
because everything is mythical for you.

00:14:02.814 --> 00:14:12.981
In every venture that we take up we should not have any fear

00:14:13.022 --> 00:14:20.139
because God is with you. Is a fact, is the truth. You just try.

00:14:20.139 --> 00:14:25.397
But when you try through your ego you fall into the trap of fear.

00:14:25.397 --> 00:14:29.022
I have seen egoistical people are the most frightened people,

00:14:29.064 --> 00:14:32.522
and panicked, because they panic others

00:14:32.563 --> 00:14:35.814
and so they think they can be panicked one day.

00:14:35.814 --> 00:14:40.271
When the English were here, first of all, in India,

00:14:40.271 --> 00:14:44.939
we were all frightened of them. Now I see

00:14:44.981 --> 00:14:49.022
that in England every English family is frightened of others.

00:14:49.022 --> 00:14:52.647
They’ll only open a chink of the door to see who is there,

00:14:52.689 --> 00:14:56.981
and shut it. They’re so frightened. I’m surprised,

00:14:57.022 --> 00:14:59.022
they are the same English who ruled us here.

00:14:59.022 --> 00:15:01.647
And we were so peevish before them and now

00:15:01.689 --> 00:15:03.939
they are the ones who are frightened of us;

00:15:03.981 --> 00:15:07.313
because when a person who is egoistical tries to dominate others

00:15:07.355 --> 00:15:11.522
he sees himself in the mirror and thinks

00:15:11.522 --> 00:15:13.855
that the other person will dominate him.

00:15:13.897 --> 00:15:17.647
That’s how this fear creeps in, into our minds,

00:15:17.647 --> 00:15:21.855
and we start getting all kinds of these stupid tantrums

00:15:21.897 --> 00:15:25.147
out of this mythical fear.

00:15:25.189 --> 00:15:30.189
The fear is created by our ego.

00:15:30.231 --> 00:15:36.355
A person who has no ego, he’ll have no fear

00:15:36.355 --> 00:15:37.855
because he has not harmed anyone.

00:15:37.897 --> 00:15:41.855
Why should he have any fear? And such a man, or such a woman,

00:15:41.897 --> 00:15:45.814
will be looked after by God, because God takes over.

00:15:45.855 --> 00:15:50.730
When you surrender your ego to God He takes over.

00:15:50.772 --> 00:15:54.730
But those who have ego He says, “All right, go ahead,

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.981
use your ego, try to protect yourself, cut your throat.”

00:15:57.981 --> 00:16:06.064
That’s what it is. So when I talk of total benevolence

00:16:06.064 --> 00:16:11.355
I’m talking about your own total benevolence.

00:16:11.397 --> 00:16:13.272
So first is the fear,

00:16:13.313 --> 00:16:16.605
which should go out of your mind completely

00:16:16.647 --> 00:16:21.106
if you believe in the Almighty God. We’ll say,

00:16:21.147 --> 00:16:23.814
“You are Almighty God, you are almighty this thing”

00:16:23.814 --> 00:16:27.438
It's all lip-service. If you believe that God is almighty,

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.231
and you are connected with God,

00:16:29.271 --> 00:16:32.106
then why should you have any fear of anything?

00:16:32.106 --> 00:16:37.064
But when we say, “Don’t have fear,” another extreme comes up,

00:16:37.064 --> 00:16:40.064
“We don’t have fear, we can do what we like,

00:16:40.106 --> 00:16:45.272
we can perform everything ourselves, we need not tell anyone.”

00:16:45.313 --> 00:16:49.397
You have to tell God whatever you are doing.

00:16:49.438 --> 00:16:56.022
You have to take permission, you have to inform in His darbar [court],

00:16:56.022 --> 00:17:02.689
in His court, that, “Sir, we are thinking of doing such and such thing.”

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:09.022
But you think you are God. You are not.

00:17:09.064 --> 00:17:13.064
And that’s why the another part of non-fear

00:17:13.106 --> 00:17:15.939
is this kind of an arbitrary behavior

00:17:15.981 --> 00:17:18.480
which is very dangerous for Sahaja Yoga,

00:17:18.522 --> 00:17:21.189
for yourself, and for everybody else.

00:17:21.231 --> 00:17:31.772
The second fear, I mean, I have, is that if I tell you anything,

00:17:31.814 --> 00:17:37.231
99 percent of you understand is for your benevolence,

00:17:37.271 --> 00:17:40.855
is for your good. But there is one [1] percent of people

00:17:40.855 --> 00:17:46.814
who can just react because they have too much ego and they won’t take it,

00:17:46.814 --> 00:17:49.772
because they don’t think of their own benevolence.

00:17:49.772 --> 00:17:53.647
They don’t understand that if I am telling them anything,

00:17:53.689 --> 00:18:00.939
it is just to give them completeness, totality.

00:18:00.981 --> 00:18:05.563
But, on the contrary, they take a very wrong attitude;

00:18:05.563 --> 00:18:10.189
this is another nonsensity. So now one has to develop

00:18:10.189 --> 00:18:14.522
a kind of a indifference to this kind of people

00:18:14.522 --> 00:18:19.647
who unnecessarily go to the other limit of their own destruction,

00:18:19.689 --> 00:18:23.689
and don’t want to see what is the point in everything

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:26.939
that I am telling you. Only I can tell you. Who else?

00:18:26.981 --> 00:18:29.522
I have to tell you what’s wrong with you,

00:18:29.522 --> 00:18:32.355
what you have done wrong, and then you must change it.

00:18:32.397 --> 00:18:39.313
This is another style of reaction one gets,

00:18:39.355 --> 00:18:41.897
means they are not interested in their own benevolence,

00:18:41.897 --> 00:18:45.271
they’re not interested in the benevolence of their children,

00:18:45.271 --> 00:18:49.647
they’re not interested in the benevolence of their country or the whole world.

00:18:49.647 --> 00:18:53.522
Now why have you come to Sahaja Yoga? Just ask one question.

00:18:53.522 --> 00:18:57.897
Of course for you to ascend. But ascend for what?

00:18:57.897 --> 00:19:01.689
Supposing we bring one tube light.

00:19:01.689 --> 00:19:05.897
For what we have to take the tube light? But for what?

00:19:05.939 --> 00:19:09.313
We have to put the light. But this tube light doesn’t give light,

00:19:09.355 --> 00:19:12.730
nothing of the kind, so what’s the use of having this tube light?

00:19:12.772 --> 00:19:17.438
In the same way, what’s the use of coming to Sahaja Yoga

00:19:17.438 --> 00:19:24.522
if you cannot become the light of the Divine?

00:19:24.522 --> 00:19:34.772
So all of you, each one of you, is not at all a small person;

00:19:34.772 --> 00:19:37.981
no one; but you don’t realize what you are;

00:19:38.022 --> 00:19:42.814
still have those funny conditionings by which you think

00:19:42.814 --> 00:19:45.397
you are no good. All of you can come up,

00:19:45.397 --> 00:19:49.689
and see so many people. If they take to total benevolence

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:57.397
within themselves it will manifest itself outside; absolutely; it’s a fact.

00:19:57.397 --> 00:20:03.147
Then the attention is very important.

00:20:03.189 --> 00:20:07.605
The attention should be on your own perfection

00:20:07.647 --> 00:20:14.189
and on your total benevolence. This is also another point people miss,

00:20:14.231 --> 00:20:16.772
that they start finding faults with others

00:20:16.814 --> 00:20:20.397
instead of finding faults with themselves.

00:20:20.438 --> 00:20:26.106
As a result, if you look at others, what will you get out of it?

00:20:26.147 --> 00:20:31.689
I just don’t understand. If somebody is wrong,

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:35.231
he’s doing something evil, he's bad, even if you put attention to him,

00:20:35.231 --> 00:20:41.939
what will you do about it? But if you have something wrong,

00:20:41.981 --> 00:20:44.438
you have every right, you have every control,

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:53.106
and you can correct yourself. This is especially Indian quality,

00:20:53.106 --> 00:20:55.271
is to find faults with others.

00:20:55.271 --> 00:20:59.689
They’ll never see that what’s wrong with us.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:05.647
All the time the attention is involved in finding with faults with others.

00:21:05.689 --> 00:21:12.605
Then how can we improve? On the contrary,

00:21:12.605 --> 00:21:16.563
if you start seeing faults, you get faulty much more.

00:21:16.605 --> 00:21:21.022
It’s a copycat nature of human beings.

00:21:21.064 --> 00:21:23.522
They see somebody doing like this,

00:21:23.563 --> 00:21:26.480
“Oh Mother, he’s a Sahaja yogi, he does like this,

00:21:26.522 --> 00:21:28.689
so what’s the harm if I do?”

00:21:28.689 --> 00:21:30.939
But who says he’s a Sahaja yogi?

00:21:30.939 --> 00:21:34.897
So ‘Sahaja yogi’ is not a brand, it's not a certificate,

00:21:34.939 --> 00:21:41.689
it’s not a kind of a organization, but it is your own status

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:45.189
that you have achieved. Anybody can say,

00:21:45.231 --> 00:21:48.064
“I’m a Sahaja Yogi.” After all I cannot stop him from saying.

00:21:48.106 --> 00:21:51.064
I’m not such and such. Even I have seen some mad people,

00:21:51.064 --> 00:21:53.689
they are Sahaja yogis, for years together they’re mad,

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:59.689
but they’re Sahaja yogis. But you have to see for yourself,

00:21:59.689 --> 00:22:02.772
am I a Sahaja yogi or not? Before certifying yourself,

00:22:02.814 --> 00:22:09.022
why don’t you find out? But despite that, I must say,

00:22:09.064 --> 00:22:14.480
it's such a satisfaction. I never expected that so many people

00:22:14.522 --> 00:22:17.313
will get their realization to begin with, never.

00:22:17.355 --> 00:22:24.106
I mean, I knew that it was amass modus operandi I have developed,

00:22:24.106 --> 00:22:29.438
but I never expected. But it has happened,

00:22:29.480 --> 00:22:35.147
and even now I have to expect that all of you

00:22:35.189 --> 00:22:40.022
will achieve the highest, highest positions, the paramapada [supreme state],

00:22:40.022 --> 00:22:45.438
as I said, like the North Pole, or like the Meru; absolutely ”Atala” [firm]

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:48.605
‘which cannot be disturbed’. So that’s My hope,

00:22:48.647 --> 00:22:51.438
and I’m sure you will all comply with it.

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:57.272
Should speak in Marathi now, as many people do not understand the English language.

00:22:58.272 --> 00:23:02.272
It doesn't matter; there is nothing worthwhile about the English language.

00:23:02.272 --> 00:23:04.772
There is no language like Marathi.

00:23:04.772 --> 00:23:07.672
And again, the Marathi language is there to gain knowledge of the Soul.

00:23:07.772 --> 00:23:13.272
And saints and sages have worked so much here; the work with the Kundalini we do is of the Natha sect itself.

00:23:13.672 --> 00:23:20.672
But what I want to say is that although the Marathi language is at a very high level and Maharashtra has the Kundalini of the entire universe,

00:23:20.772 --> 00:23:27.672
Maharashtrian people's minds are nevertheless upside down these days; I don't know what has caused it.

00:23:27.772 --> 00:23:32.672
What has happened in politics has also happened in our own homes—within Sahaja Yoga.

00:23:32.672 --> 00:23:37.672
Everyone is looking to pull each other down [pulling each other’s leg]; I don’t understand why people are doing this.

00:23:37.772 --> 00:23:42.672
Hey, if there is no unity among you, no collectiveness among you,

00:23:42.872 --> 00:23:47.672
then did I work hard for so many days here for this individual form of yours?

00:23:47.672 --> 00:23:51.672
And have the saints and sages told only this?

00:23:51.772 --> 00:23:55.672
It was told to the extent that “Those alone will be your relations.”

00:23:55.772 --> 00:24:01.072
Hey, why did that Saint Gyaneshwara tell so much? I don't understand who this was told to.

00:24:01.072 --> 00:24:04.072
It seems to be said for people abroad,

00:24:04.072 --> 00:24:06.372
because it doesn't affect anyone here.

00:24:07.072 --> 00:24:12.672
Who [are] your relations? Those Sahaja Yogis alone.

00:24:12.772 --> 00:24:16.772
But “This person has made this mistake,” “That person has made this mistake”— and they send big-big letters to me.

00:24:16.772 --> 00:24:19.772
Will I feel good listening to these things?

00:24:19.772 --> 00:24:24.772
Should you be keeping the Goddess happy or should you be writing such letters to Her?

00:24:24.772 --> 00:24:25.772
Now, every time I say that, I wonder who I'm talking to.

00:24:25.772 --> 00:24:31.772
O you saint, sage, I made you a saint, made saint, brought you to such a high state.

00:24:32.772 --> 00:24:41.272
You were taken to that unshakable position like a Dhruva, and now where are you lying here?

00:24:41.272 --> 00:24:42.772
I don't understand what to call this.

00:24:42.772 --> 00:24:47.772
Even though Marathi is such a graceful, such an intense,

00:24:47.772 --> 00:24:51.772
and extremely good language for self-knowledge

00:24:51.772 --> 00:24:55.772
—that should be the need of the Marathi listeners, no?

00:24:55.772 --> 00:24:59.772
If it does not get into their heads, so then what use is it to tell?

00:24:59.772 --> 00:25:05.172
On the other hand, people have done countless things with Kundalini.

00:25:05.772 --> 00:25:10.272
Now, [I am] telling them in Hindi.

00:25:10.272 --> 00:25:16.272
Marathi people should accept the truth that [their] language is a wonderful language for Self-Realization;

00:25:16.272 --> 00:25:17.772
there is no doubt about it.

00:25:17.772 --> 00:25:21.772
It has not been written more clearly than this in any language.

00:25:21.772 --> 00:25:30.272
And in this regard, because people show respect to Lord Ganesha, they are of good character—as a matter of fact.

00:25:30.272 --> 00:25:32.272
Their eyes do not roam about here and there.

00:25:32.272 --> 00:25:37.272
In North India, because of the Muslim rule and because of their “pardah [veil]” system,

00:25:37.272 --> 00:25:42.672
they have a custom of looking at every person who is moving around; everyone.

00:25:42.672 --> 00:25:44.872
I used to think in the beginning, what are all these people doing?

00:25:44.872 --> 00:25:51.072
Whatever it is, now, after coming to Sahaja Yoga.

00:25:51.072 --> 00:25:57.672
In the Marathi language, on Self-Realization, many scriptures and many things have been written—amazing.

00:25:57.672 --> 00:26:02.672
The one effect of these writings on these people has been that they are not womanizers.

00:26:02.672 --> 00:26:05.272
They don’t get trapped in this, so much in Maharashtra.

00:26:05.272 --> 00:26:10.772
There are some who got involved with women; they all have gone now and are sitting in Delhi.

00:26:10.772 --> 00:26:16.772
But whoever is here has one specialty within them, and that is their good character.

00:26:16.772 --> 00:26:26.772
And in North India, I was amazed to see that even among those who had never heard of Dattatreya,

00:26:26.772 --> 00:26:34.172
how there was such awareness?

00:26:34.172 --> 00:26:38.772
There was no sign of conflict or trouble anywhere.

00:26:38.772 --> 00:26:43.772
The program went on so well that everyone was astonished.

00:26:43.272 --> 00:26:48.772
If I have to say in Marathi, when people from abroad arrive here, the main focus is on how to extract money from them.

00:26:48.772 --> 00:26:52.772
It is not like this there [North India].

00:26:52.772 --> 00:27:02.772
And by doing all this, they have shown that, in whichever trough [pitiable condition] they were lying,

00:27:02.772 --> 00:27:04.772
they have risen from that absolutely and become like lotuses.

00:27:04.772 --> 00:27:06.772
This they have shown.

00:27:06.772 --> 00:27:13.772
Now in Maharashtra, because all these things are there and everything has been written,

00:27:13.772 --> 00:27:18.762
the saints and sages worked so hard here.

00:27:18.772 --> 00:27:21.772
so,where there is so much effort,
I think that is where things go wrong.

00:27:21.772 --> 00:27:29.772
Everything is known to them.

00:27:29.772 --> 00:27:35.772
Even after knowing everything, they have muddled everything.

00:27:35.772 --> 00:27:38.772
So, it is better that don’t have to know anything;

00:27:38.772 --> 00:27:44.772
just realize one thing that “mutual love” is the biggest and prime mantra of Sahaja Yoga.

00:27:44.772 --> 00:27:47.772
Then a lot of work will be done.

00:27:47.772 --> 00:27:51.772
Otherwise, hear mantra after mantra from them; hear everything.

00:27:51.772 --> 00:27:58.772
They know everything in the world, but the moment they see each other, they start swearing.

00:27:58.772 --> 00:28:09.772
Now, by experience, it has been proven that in North India, it is an amazing thing the way people have accepted Sahaja Yoga.

00:28:09.772 --> 00:28:20.072
amazing thing, very amazing. In my opinion, if this happens in Maharashtra also, then what more do I want?

00:28:20.272 --> 00:28:26.772
In this small part of India, wonder how many saints and sages have taken birth.

00:28:26.772 --> 00:28:34.772
And those saints and sages have been recognized by all the people of India.

00:28:34.772 --> 00:28:37.772
They have written such valuable phrases, which are worth reading.

00:28:37.772 --> 00:28:49.772
And their majesty cannot be described at all.

00:28:49.772 --> 00:28:56.772
Now, that element is deeply ingrained and woven into the local culture.

00:28:56.772 --> 00:29:00.772
But they are not able to get into Sahaja Yoga.

00:29:00.772 --> 00:29:04.272
There is one thing in Sahaja Yoga: the culture of Sahaja Yoga should be accepted

00:29:04.272 --> 00:29:10.272
—the greatest thing in the culture of Sahaja Yoga is mutual love.

00:29:10.272 --> 00:29:16.272
If we don’t feel love for one another, then we are not Sahaja Yogis.

00:29:16.272 --> 00:29:25.772
As long as one Sahaj Yogi cannot express his love for the other, we cannot become Yogis at all.

00:29:25.772 --> 00:29:33.272
If we are busy cutting each other’s throats, then we cannot be Sahaja Yogi in any way.

00:29:33.272 --> 00:29:37.772
You need not see others’ drawbacks.

00:29:37.772 --> 00:29:42.272
See his virtues and describe his goodness, and he also will become a good.

00:29:42.272 --> 00:29:44.472
I do it many times.

00:29:44.472 --> 00:29:48.272
If someone comes and tells me that this person is like this, he did this wrong, he did this.

00:29:48.272 --> 00:29:52.272
“Arrey! He was appreciating you, and you are talking ill of him?”

00:29:52.272 --> 00:29:54.272
“Is that so? What did he say mother?”

00:29:54.772 --> 00:29:55.772
“He said so many things about you.

00:29:55.772 --> 00:29:57.272
What can I say? You go and check with him.”

00:29:57.272 --> 00:30:05.472
Then this person goes and hugs him. It means this is all a lie.

00:30:05.472 --> 00:30:12.372
Now, reflect deeply on the times into which we were born.

00:30:12.372 --> 00:30:17.272
We are born in an era when a great significant task is unfolding.

00:30:17.272 --> 00:30:21.272
Very big. Regarding this, it has been mentioned that this important work will happen.

00:30:21.272 --> 00:30:24.772
When we are born at the time when this great work is happening,

00:30:24.772 --> 00:30:29.772
and we are active in that, and we are the doer of this work,

00:30:29.772 --> 00:30:33.772
when the burden of doing that work is on us, then what should we do?

00:30:34.772 --> 00:30:41.672
If four people are carrying a table and even one among them is weak,

00:30:41.672 --> 00:30:44.672
then the table will fall down.

00:30:44.672 --> 00:30:48.772
Or, in a ship, even if there is a small hole, the whole ship may drown.

00:30:48.772 --> 00:30:53.772
Because all these matters are collective.

00:30:53.772 --> 00:30:54.272
Because you all are collective.

00:30:54.272 --> 00:30:57.772
If among you even a single person takes the wrong path,

00:30:57.772 --> 00:31:00.172
the whole Sahaja Yoga is harmed by it.

00:31:00.172 --> 00:31:07.772
So, in this, we have to understand that there should be humility among us.

00:31:07.772 --> 00:31:16.772
Jesus Christ has told that “Meek in heart will inherit earth”.

00:31:16.772 --> 00:31:21.772
Among Maharashtrians, this humility is lacking.

00:31:21.772 --> 00:31:24.772
Somehow, in-spite-of their language being so beautiful,

00:31:24.772 --> 00:31:27.772
while talking, though there is no abuse in the language,

00:31:27.772 --> 00:31:32.172
still without using abusive language, they will give some or the other lesson.

00:31:32.172 --> 00:31:37.772
[This] is one of their characters.

00:31:37.772 --> 00:31:39.272
This was not there before.

00:31:39.272 --> 00:31:41.772
Earlier, it was not there; now it is there.

00:31:41.772 --> 00:31:44.772
And they are so obsessed with this that they are ready to fight everywhere.

00:31:44.772 --> 00:31:48.072
[They] would do strike everywhere, would do this and do that everywhere.

00:31:48.072 --> 00:31:50.772
Don’t understand anything.

00:31:50.772 --> 00:31:53.772
Temperament has become that of a fighter.

00:31:53.772 --> 00:32:00.272
Human being should pay attention to this fighting temperament because now we have come in Sahaja Yoga;

00:32:00.272 --> 00:32:04.772
we have worn its garlanded. Now leave all this.

00:32:04.772 --> 00:32:09.772
But they won’t listen. If you tell them to become “Warakari” [Pilgrims of Lord Vitthala*],

00:32:09.772 --> 00:32:21.772
would go on a pilgrimage for a month—chewing tobacco, wearing the robe [clothes in tattered condition], starving themselves, thousands of them.

00:32:21.772 --> 00:32:25.772
But if they are told that they have become Sahaja Yogis, so impersonate that,

00:32:25.772 --> 00:32:30.772
then it is a very difficult task.

00:32:30.772 --> 00:32:45.772
So, the most important thing—the supreme element in ‘Sahaj Dharma’—is absolute mutual love; absolute.

00:32:45.772 --> 00:32:54.772
Now look—a Muslim boy from Algeria said to his parents,

00:32:54.772 --> 00:32:57.772
"Where are you going, dear? To Mecca?"

00:32:57.772 --> 00:33:01.572
Nowadays, Mecca is stationed in London; go there.

00:33:01.572 --> 00:33:06.772
He brought them to London. So, when they met me,

00:33:06.772 --> 00:33:09.772
they said afterward, “It is true, whatever we don’t get in Mecca, we got here.”

00:33:09.772 --> 00:33:17.772
And they said, “Just the thought that we went to London brings waves of joy in our heart.”

00:33:17.772 --> 00:33:25.772
Just like this, just the thought of any Sahaja Yogi should bring flow of joy.

00:33:25.772 --> 00:33:29.772
He had remained such Sahaja Yogi.

00:33:29.772 --> 00:33:34.372
[It] is in Marathi; I have often cited this example—and I will share it again

00:33:34.372 --> 00:33:43.372
—of the time Namadev decided to meet Gora Kumbhar and went and stood there.

00:33:43.372 --> 00:33:48.272
Gora Kumbhar was busy trampling the clay.

00:33:48.272 --> 00:33:51.272
After he stood there—simply “Thakale” [showed his sudden encounter].

00:33:51.272 --> 00:33:54.672
In Hindi there is no translation but thakale.

00:33:54.672 --> 00:34:02.272
And what did he say? "I have come to meet the formless (nirguna) with the manifest (saguna)."

00:34:02.272 --> 00:34:05.472
This is the identity of a Sahaja Yogi.

00:34:05.814 --> 00:34:07.480
I’ll tell you in English. I have told you many a times

00:34:07.480 --> 00:34:10.563
about Namadeva and Gorakumbhar, how Gorakumbhar,

00:34:10.563 --> 00:34:13.855
when he saw Namadeva, Namadeva saw Gorakumbhar

00:34:13.897 --> 00:34:18.313
was kneading the clay for his pottery, pottery.

00:34:18.355 --> 00:34:22.106
he just went and stood before him stunned.

00:34:22.106 --> 00:34:30.313
And what he says that, “I have come to see here the formless”

00:34:30.355 --> 00:34:35.313
that’s the vibrations. “But the Formless is in a form”

00:34:35.355 --> 00:34:39.022
This is the appreciation one should have,

00:34:39.064 --> 00:34:41.064
one Sahaja yogi should have for another.

00:34:41.106 --> 00:34:45.022
Every Sahaja yogi is a gem.

00:34:45.064 --> 00:34:50.480
Even the thought of a gem should bring joy to you.

00:34:50.522 --> 00:34:56.064
In every life, every style, in every areas, every dimensions,

00:34:56.106 --> 00:35:03.563
one should have this kind of a feeling. Muslims, Hindus, Christians,

00:35:03.605 --> 00:35:07.147
we do not accept. For us we are all Sahaja yogis,

00:35:07.189 --> 00:35:11.271
and we have faith in all the religions, not the 'samabhaava' [to consider everyone as equal].

00:35:11.271 --> 00:35:15.271
We have faith in every thing. As well as we worship Rama

00:35:15.271 --> 00:35:19.772
we worship Muhammad Saahaab also, same way, no less.

00:35:19.814 --> 00:35:23.605
As we worship Brahmadeva, or as we worship,

00:35:23.605 --> 00:35:28.438
we say, Dattatreya, we worship Zoroaster, there’s no difference at all,

00:35:28.480 --> 00:35:33.563
same way. There’s a big difference in having just a same,

00:35:33.563 --> 00:35:38.605
what you call, the same respect; it’s not that;

00:35:38.647 --> 00:35:43.106
but we worship the same way, so there’s no question

00:35:43.106 --> 00:35:47.605
of differentiating each other; nor on country-wise, nothing.

00:35:47.605 --> 00:35:51.022
And whatever defects we have, we see to it

00:35:51.064 --> 00:35:53.189
that this has come from our country;

00:35:53.231 --> 00:35:56.605
which I see many Sahaja yogis tell Me, “This is typical English,

00:35:56.647 --> 00:36:00.189
this is typically French, this is typically Italian.”

00:36:00.231 --> 00:36:06.313
They themselves tell Me. But main thing one has to understand is this,

00:36:06.355 --> 00:36:11.147
that in Sahaja Yoga we have lost all these boundaries; nothing is there.

00:36:11.189 --> 00:36:14.271
We have reached that state where we are all one.

00:36:14.272 --> 00:36:19.730
And the idea of any Sahaja yogi whatsoever,

00:36:19.730 --> 00:36:22.563
and any individual Sahaja yogi, or a group of Sahaja yogis,

00:36:22.563 --> 00:36:31.480
should fill you up with joy and a kind of a wave of joy

00:36:31.480 --> 00:36:37.647
which is continuously coming, because they are in the form of joy,

00:36:37.689 --> 00:36:43.272
peace. If this appreciation is reached, then only one can say

00:36:43.313 --> 00:36:48.563
that you are Sahaja yogis, and that is one of the tests I have seen.

00:36:48.605 --> 00:36:51.106
You love Me very much I know, all of you,

00:36:51.106 --> 00:36:55.189
but unless and until you love each other how am I going to be happy?

00:36:55.189 --> 00:37:00.106
So today specially, this Mahalakshmi principle,

00:37:00.147 --> 00:37:05.272
when it is awakened within you, then you get out of a Lakshmi principle,

00:37:05.313 --> 00:37:08.271
which makes you a little selfish maybe, self-centered,

00:37:08.271 --> 00:37:12.147
and you get into a new dimension of searching,

00:37:12.189 --> 00:37:18.438
of searching the higher value system, something beyond,

00:37:18.480 --> 00:37:24.522
without any limitations. And that Mahalakshmi principle

00:37:24.563 --> 00:37:29.939
is really nothing, in essence, if you see, is nothing but you are seeking the universal love,

00:37:29.939 --> 00:37:36.939
in the essence it is that. We don’t love people

00:37:36.981 --> 00:37:40.313
because they belong to some country, because they look like this,

00:37:40.355 --> 00:37:43.147
that this is this; nothing; we love them

00:37:43.189 --> 00:37:49.147
only because they are our part and parcel, we are one with them.

00:37:49.189 --> 00:37:53.939
So those who are today worshipping Mahalakshmi should feel

00:37:53.939 --> 00:37:56.313
how many worshippers of Mahalakshmi are there,

00:37:56.313 --> 00:38:00.189
and they are all our own. It’s such a great feeling.

00:38:00.231 --> 00:38:07.064
Otherwise, in Maharashtra especially, I must say, it was horrible,

00:38:07.106 --> 00:38:11.272
one Sahaja yogi goes to preach in another Sahaj, another district.

00:38:11.313 --> 00:38:19.355
(Background noise) The district leader starts fighting, just like this sound,

00:38:19.355 --> 00:38:24.522
“Who are you to come here? I’m the leader”

00:38:24.563 --> 00:38:32.272
Instead of respecting him, and making him a welcome guest,

00:38:32.313 --> 00:38:37.189
asking him what can you help, there’s a big fight.

00:38:37.231 --> 00:38:43.271
It’s really surprising. How can it happen?

00:38:43.272 --> 00:38:48.563
When Namadeva went to Punjab, Guru Nanak Saahaab respected him;

00:38:48.563 --> 00:38:50.981
not only that, but he told him that,

00:38:51.022 --> 00:38:53.730
“You write now in Punjabi language also.”

00:38:53.772 --> 00:38:57.313
I have seen such a big book written by Namadeva. Can you imagine?

00:38:57.313 --> 00:39:02.438
He included all the great saints of Maharashtra in his Granth Saaheb,

00:39:02.480 --> 00:39:08.147
because he knew that these are realized souls, they are higher souls.

00:39:08.189 --> 00:39:12.189
But these Sikhs are only reading it; nothing goes into their heads.

00:39:12.231 --> 00:39:17.814
What can you do? So at that time,

00:39:17.814 --> 00:39:20.981
if these saints could love each other,

00:39:21.022 --> 00:39:26.647
could express themselves in such a manner, why not we,

00:39:26.647 --> 00:39:29.064
the Sahaja yogis from all over the world?

00:39:29.106 --> 00:39:34.106
So I would say now, that, let us see, it’s a very nice program of Raas [folk dance linked to Lord Krishna &amp; Gopis]

00:39:34.147 --> 00:39:39.231
we’ll be having, where all the Indian and foreign Sahaja yogis are going to be together,

00:39:39.271 --> 00:39:42.772
and are going to dance together. All such things are there.

00:39:42.814 --> 00:39:47.647
So don’t sit in groups, but mix up with others, know them,

00:39:47.689 --> 00:39:50.814
and this is what we are going to know;

00:39:50.855 --> 00:39:55.772
each and every Sahaja yogi of the whole world.

00:39:55.814 --> 00:40:01.397
Is very important for Me that you should love each other.

00:40:01.438 --> 00:40:06.189
It will really soothe Me the most, it will give Me the greatest joy,

00:40:06.231 --> 00:40:14.064
the greatest achievement, and the fulfillment of My life.

00:40:14.106 --> 00:40:21.814
If somebody is really, definitely wrong, you just write to Me

00:40:21.814 --> 00:40:25.480
and I will know, because immediately I’ll know from vibrations.

00:40:25.522 --> 00:40:27.647
Nobody can befool Me, that’s one thing for sure.

00:40:27.689 --> 00:40:29.939
Some people say that, “Somebody has told this to Mother."

00:40:29.981 --> 00:40:32.231
Nothing can be told to Mother, you don’t know;

00:40:32.271 --> 00:40:35.897
I am too cunning for all this. Nobody can tell Me anything;

00:40:35.939 --> 00:40:38.313
I know each and every... I play around a little bit,

00:40:38.355 --> 00:40:41.939
but I know each and every person. I give them a chance

00:40:41.981 --> 00:40:44.106
to hang themselves for a time being.

00:40:44.106 --> 00:40:48.397
But never believe that anybody can befool Me, and tell anything.

00:40:48.397 --> 00:40:57.981
I listen to everyone, and you can try that.

00:40:58.022 --> 00:41:02.605
If you love another Sahaja yogi,

00:41:02.605 --> 00:41:07.730
this loving process itself is so joy giving.

00:41:07.772 --> 00:41:14.897
When you first saw Me this time on the stage, you felt that way,

00:41:14.939 --> 00:41:21.438
because this process of loving is the greatest joy-giving thing.

00:41:21.480 --> 00:41:27.271
So be happy, be joyous. If some people are missing the plane,

00:41:27.271 --> 00:41:30.189
well and good, you will live with other Sahaja yogis,

00:41:30.231 --> 00:41:33.647
you are after all, you are somewhere in the world, you are not lost.

00:41:33.647 --> 00:41:37.022
Even if you are in the sea, you are there, on the plane you are there.

00:41:37.022 --> 00:41:42.772
What does it matter? Why is it so important

00:41:42.814 --> 00:41:46.689
that this plane must be reserved, and you must worry about this plane,

00:41:46.730 --> 00:41:49.563
“I must get out at this time” There’s no need.

00:41:49.563 --> 00:41:53.355
Wherever you are you are with Sahaja yogis,

00:41:53.397 --> 00:41:55.231
so why worry?

00:41:55.231 --> 00:42:01.022
You are, that’s the point. Like many people ask Me,

00:42:01.022 --> 00:42:03.563
“Mother You travel so much, how is it You don’t get tired?”

00:42:03.563 --> 00:42:06.189
Because I never think I am travelling, I just think, “I am,”

00:42:06.231 --> 00:42:09.189
that’s all. Whether in the plane or here, or there,

00:42:09.189 --> 00:42:13.647
I am just there. I have to tell Me I am traveling,

00:42:13.647 --> 00:42:19.313
then again I forget. So you are,

00:42:19.355 --> 00:42:23.064
whether you are here or in England, or anywhere,

00:42:23.106 --> 00:42:28.939
or you are here or you are there. So why to worry?

00:42:28.939 --> 00:42:31.730
Specially with the plane - I think there is something wrong

00:42:31.730 --> 00:42:37.897
with the Western genetics - the plane enters into their Kundalini,

00:42:37.939 --> 00:42:42.271
I think, and they go so bizarre with the airplanes.

00:42:42.271 --> 00:42:45.772
Something I’ve never been able to understand it.

00:42:45.772 --> 00:42:49.231
I’ve given them so many lessons to show that don’t do all this nonsense,

00:42:49.271 --> 00:42:51.355
but still they go on doing like this.

00:42:51.397 --> 00:42:54.647
But if I tell them they feel guilty,but again they do it.

00:42:54.689 --> 00:42:58.106
Next time if your plane is eight o’clock,

00:42:58.147 --> 00:43:02.772
go at nine o’clock, the plane will wait for you till ten o’clock,

00:43:02.814 --> 00:43:07.397
take it from Me. It has happened; so many can tell this.

00:43:07.438 --> 00:43:13.480
So many experiences are there. I mean, we haven’t written them down,

00:43:13.522 --> 00:43:17.480
but people know how planes have been delayed for us.

00:43:17.480 --> 00:43:21.647
I have never missed a plane all My life, and when I missed it,

00:43:21.647 --> 00:43:24.189
it was with a purpose; these big things happened.

00:43:24.189 --> 00:43:27.397
So it is important, it’s a drama.

00:43:27.438 --> 00:43:35.189
The worry should be one:

00:43:35.231 --> 00:43:42.814
“Why can’t I love everyone as I love myself?”

00:43:42.814 --> 00:43:50.022
I tell you only this universal love will give you

00:43:50.064 --> 00:43:55.313
that confidence and that higher status.

00:43:55.355 --> 00:43:58.022
Why these saints suffered for you?

00:43:58.022 --> 00:44:02.397
Why did Christ suffer for you?

00:44:02.397 --> 00:44:04.022
Why Muhammad Saahaab suffered for you?

00:44:04.064 --> 00:44:06.438
Why anybody talked to you about Dharma?

00:44:06.480 --> 00:44:11.397
Why Gnaneshwara wrote Gnaneshwari? Why?

00:44:11.438 --> 00:44:13.522
What did they get?

00:44:13.563 --> 00:44:20.772
This satisfaction of their expression of universal love.

00:44:20.814 --> 00:44:25.231
All the great poets, William Blake or anyone,

00:44:25.231 --> 00:44:27.480
whatever they have done, it’s just

00:44:27.480 --> 00:44:31.522
because they have this universal love and they want to express it.

00:44:31.563 --> 00:44:33.231
Why not you do it?

00:44:33.271 --> 00:44:38.271
So if you want your Mahalakshmi principle

00:44:38.313 --> 00:44:41.939
to be all the time burning, then please

00:44:41.981 --> 00:44:46.064
see that you love each and every Sahaja yogi.

00:44:46.106 --> 00:44:48.814
That’s the message today. I hope you’ll understand that.

00:44:48.855 --> 00:44:51.689
May God bless you.